            <div xml:id="m-56279352-8f7e-43c1-a9fb-34c45e7feaa0">
              <lg xml:id="m-0b23e279-9db2-418d-a785-069c860bdc57">
                <l xml:id="m-e21e4b12-eeb5-4c06-a72d-acc8af579932" facs="#m-f1df552d-8e7e-4fb4-990c-825c01b25aab" label="ambiguous">ais</l><l xml:id="m-2acc55fe-a297-49f2-8553-28d0def24201" facs="#m-ba680839-2bc0-4035-a7de-f2afdb42551e" label="text-like">St. Stephen, The First Martyr.</l><l xml:id="m-f420b871-775e-4804-a1af-1ade77bc96db" facs="#m-4a682e55-d5d8-4e70-9319-dad1869c1eaa" label="ambiguous">comm.</l><l xml:id="m-a4bd62bf-b3c1-41eb-b1b7-424426d7cadc" facs="#m-013a5ba4-64a8-4328-8b1c-14943fe28c6f" label="ambiguous">s.</l><l xml:id="m-36522feb-33c2-4951-afcd-6e0285319642" facs="#m-0c92ce8d-64af-4076-9192-0b6909f5e1cf" label="lyrics-like">I-de-o" caélos a-pértos, et Jésum stántem a</l><l xml:id="m-556ada30-49f6-43c2-880b-a59e4ded40f0" facs="#m-41248ad3-ceda-4bc9-894b-05808f40407a" label="ambiguous">A</l><l xml:id="m-48c722c4-ada3-45a9-a521-b6f9b227f9ae" facs="#m-ab2d57f2-5c6a-4dca-9f4b-eb42eae1f100" label="lyrics-like">déxtris virtú-tis Dé¬</l><l xml:id="m-7bd0eca3-8d6b-43bd-b079-0472ec881437" facs="#m-1ea458fe-9287-426e-8154-f1131a736274" label="lyrics-like">i: Dómi-ne Jésu,</l><l xml:id="m-e5760d4e-c895-47e2-a384-a4416bfd1d5b" facs="#m-ce33d136-b50a-46f9-9360-99a0ddbe83be" label="lyrics-like">áccipe</l><l xml:id="m-8ae31e86-feb6-4859-9f6a-4f8f3283f1ec" facs="#m-b69019e3-0e35-40e6-be8c-e0b7ae37d530" label="lyrics-like">spí-ri-tum mé¬</l><l xml:id="m-310c39a2-08e4-4f8d-a4ed-15bb82194335" facs="#m-ae3e1872-12d2-46b9-9993-9cfb357e2922" label="lyrics-like">et ne stá-tu-as fllis hoc peccá¬</l><l xml:id="m-99fb5c9e-0795-4ae7-9238-788feda42e29" facs="#m-56e3d6dd-459a-49da-a9f9-156350b36cd4" label="ambiguous">um,</l><l xml:id="m-a6ba99c0-b048-4e72-af9c-756c1d782436" facs="#m-3430eb62-f29d-4a27-b833-6ee0a00f09c8" label="lyrics-like">tum, qui- a nésci-unt quid fá-ci- unt.</l><l xml:id="m-70726d4f-d34c-474b-b8af-fbcbb462eb68" facs="#m-30e47c17-5fe7-4c41-992b-3fadc8d3a680" label="ambiguous">Postcommunion.</l><l xml:id="m-5d1b88fb-d53f-4155-be5b-596b3612019f" facs="#m-75b3e7f0-2a4b-49d1-b56e-fab21fb950f3" label="lyrics-like">HUxiliéntur nobis, Dómine, sum- pitérna protectióne confirment. Per</l><l xml:id="m-8f701a31-b6cd-42ab-84a0-3e802ff63a26" facs="#m-a4c44916-1de0-44b5-a0aa-7ce8f94dd149" label="lyrics-like">Il pta mystéria: et, intercedénte</l><l xml:id="m-2056184f-4acc-435d-85fc-2121ee88569f" facs="#m-8575ca28-ef9d-43c0-8183-2faa98fd0ef2" label="lyrics-like">Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-d53a0a1b-2ec4-4707-8b7e-34bd5a629942" facs="#m-68f7cdef-c8ed-4b89-aad2-0637e014e8f2" label="lyrics-like">beáto Stéphano Mártyre tuo, sem¬</l><l xml:id="m-1050e0b2-9964-4c1f-8ded-d9a95476faa4" facs="#m-394f9bdf-2027-492a-a8fd-6fa56650e44b" label="lyrics-like">Commemoration of the Nativity. Postcommunion. Praesta quaésumus. p. 411.</l><l xml:id="m-9acdd28b-876e-4543-bc08-70a04709e7d5" facs="#m-b943335a-7a04-4195-b6fc-2c11971e2080" label="text-like">AT SEXT.</l><l xml:id="m-b97a01ce-60a1-4521-89ab-83be5c6ef6df" facs="#m-a8ca3576-bd66-470e-9b7f-16bc460e7282" label="ambiguous">Ant.</l><l xml:id="m-8b95269e-dd6e-4695-b2fb-731d7ce4903d" facs="#m-3f13b0c3-7e37-4f8c-b9f1-042fc977ea86" label="ambiguous">8.6</l><l xml:id="m-50e3085c-aea6-4053-b642-b46bff7bb6e1" facs="#m-0471c51b-e92d-4657-974f-a362ed74a833" label="lyrics-like">Dhaésit“ ánima mé-a post te, qui-a cá-ro mé-a</l><l xml:id="m-ee913916-6273-4112-adea-31949b6b66c7" facs="#m-8c02bb60-163e-4fbd-a8b3-9b4a9f72f3bd" label="lyrics-like">lapidá-ta est pro te, Dé-us mé-us. E u ou a e.</l><l xml:id="m-9e349a01-ff39-44c4-99ed-d3764f06e4e4" facs="#m-a846ee22-7455-49b7-a53f-b69b74563574" label="ambiguous">Chapter.</l><l xml:id="m-3bcdbe07-a913-4821-a800-f55f9930caca" facs="#m-6625d673-4b79-495c-8a3e-6a07f5a8029a" label="lyrics-like">Acts ó. c.</l><l xml:id="m-c9fbcff7-6085-4920-949a-e33844985b98" facs="#m-6156ff20-69bf-4fd3-8266-15d851afc68e" label="lyrics-like">NUrrexérunt autem quidam de erant a Cilicia, et Asia, disputánte:</l><l xml:id="m-0ce06bc7-f3ae-4aec-81ca-11992ad6dfcb" facs="#m-3c842287-b97d-4c5c-8d62-2b506ea6012d" label="lyrics-like">A synagóga, quae appellátur Li¬</l><l xml:id="m-746bf2b4-1bee-4c97-b186-354756b6e252" facs="#m-38c84675-fdc0-4c74-8587-9f94d72c985f" label="lyrics-like">cum Stéphano:“ et non póterant</l><l xml:id="m-7891fb47-4282-4380-acdd-2c7b72b2e0dc" facs="#m-2b1f0c56-5287-4ba5-acf9-548c699a3a56" label="lyrics-like">bertinórum, et Cyrenénsium, et</l><l xml:id="m-fc225ddb-5957-4cd1-9060-18df187bb573" facs="#m-d4a0a02e-d64e-472a-b694-b289df31ae54" label="lyrics-like">resistere sapiéntiae et Spiritui qui</l><l xml:id="m-77d03510-36f2-48a4-834e-fedebc0acc09" facs="#m-817a63a4-356f-4ca5-9501-4a04703c9716" label="lyrics-like">Alexandrinórum, f et eórum quil loquebátur.</l><l xml:id="m-28ca0f41-1955-40e1-b23f-f850e84d37ba" facs="#m-94fcc879-3f90-4833-9723-fc76513223b0" label="lyrics-like">Short Resp. Posuísti Dómine. V. Mágna est. from the Common of "</l><l xml:id="m-f9aefd1e-f9a6-45de-ad3e-f82201c800c6" facs="#m-76d5b20d-02e4-4b8b-887a-66c53a0d361a" label="ambiguous">Martyr, p. 1124.</l><l xml:id="m-f8473847-6fda-41bc-a3c0-65926602ca31" facs="#m-72e36923-d3a9-4565-9249-950793b68dac" label="text-like">AT NONE.</l><l xml:id="m-85471e3d-a3df-4298-aded-0f7eb6f33e74" facs="#m-2b0eb7b5-b147-42ca-b11e-11eba40c1c1e" label="ambiguous">Ant.</l><l xml:id="m-b51c5f89-3f90-4fec-9cfd-709534cb9ab8" facs="#m-81f6210d-a892-4035-a12f-d5ec53e71585" label="ambiguous">4.A</l><l xml:id="m-ccecb4b2-0dd6-4e8f-877d-dc893a3bd856" facs="#m-9dc66552-98d9-4406-993f-6137f41b8ecc" label="lyrics-like">Cce víde-o“caélos a-pértos,</l><l xml:id="m-30790067-a2f6-42d9-a92d-0ca8e3446213" facs="#m-53dfa667-c0af-4af2-ba11-97c5c45f819f" label="ambiguous">M</l><l xml:id="m-881c3323-7893-4f8a-b7f3-ee0e8d822d04" facs="#m-7633024d-5a8f-455f-bb94-602c2beb1aa6" label="lyrics-like">et Jésum stántem</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
